        <link:link rdf:resource="#item_73"/>
        <dc:title>Cookies, the GDPR, and the ePrivacy Directive</dc:title>
        <dcterms:abstract>Cookies can give businesses insight into their users’ online activity. Unforunately they are subject to both the GDPR and the ePrivacy Directive, making compliance difficult.</dcterms:abstract>
